Release the bellows of the forge upon your surroundings, inflicting [29, 40, 47, 54, 60 (TL1-5; MP 100)] mind damage, [29, 40, 47, 54, 60 (TL1-5; MP 100)] burning damage, and knocking back your enemies in a radius [3, 3, 4, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] cone.

Empty terrain may be changed (50% chance) for [2, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] turns into forge walls, which block movement and inflict [2.68, 3.61, 4.33, 4.94, 5.48 (TL1-5; MP 100)] mind and [2.68, 3.61, 4.33, 4.94, 5.48 (TL1-5; MP 100)] fire damage on nearby enemies.

The damage and knockback chance will scale with your Mindpower.
